      "description": "The University of Texas Rio Grande Valley Job Site | Job Alert Skip to Main Content Home Search Jobs Job Alerts Log In /Create Account Help Office Location The University of Texas Rio Grande Valley 1201 W. University Drive Human Resources MASS Building 2 nd Floor Edinburg, TX  78539 Edinburg: (956)665-2451 Brownsville: (956) 882-8205 Office hours: Monday-Friday 8:00a.m. - 5:00p.m. Staff Recruitment: careers@utrgv.edu School of Medicine Recruitment: SOMCareers@utrgv.edu Graduate Assistantships: assistantships@utrgv.edu Faculty Recruitment: College of Engineering & Computer Science: cecs@utrgv.edu Robert C. Vackar College of Business & Entrepreneurship: cobe@utrgv.edu College of Sciences Office of the Dean: cos@utrgv.edu College of Education and P-16 Integration: cep@utrgv.edu College of Fine Arts: cofa@utrgv.edu College of Liberal Arts: liberalarts@utrgv.edu Website: https://careers.utrgv.edu Job Alerts Indicate which categories you are interested in, and select Subscribe to\n      begin receiving notifications when new Postings\n      are open to applications. Email * First Name * Last Name * Select All Clear All Academic Administration Academic Advising/Support Services Accounting/Finance Administrative Admissions/Registration Advertising/Marketing Alumni Affairs Athletics Business Administration Counseling Curriculum & Instructional Development Engineering/Sciences Executive Leadership Facilities/Maintenance/Trades Faculty - Adjunct Faculty - Business & Entrepreneurship Faculty - Education Faculty - Engineering/Sciences Faculty - Fine Arts Faculty - Health Affairs Faculty - Liberal Arts Faculty - Sciences Faculty - Tenure Track Faculty Affairs Financial Aid Graduate Assistantships Health/Medical Human Resources Information Technology Legal Affairs Libraries/Archives Police/Security Research/Laboratory Student Affairs/Services Technology Administration The University of Texas Rio Grande Valley UT System Employee Benefits UT System Fraud Report